@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title US024 - To get the list of items on auction of a given publication

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System :  I want to get the list of items\n on auction of a given publication
activate System
Buyer <-- System : Here is the list of publication titles.\n Pick one.
deactivate System
Buyer -> System : title
activate System
System --> Buyer : Here is the list of auction listings\n for the selected publication.
deactivate System

@enduml